cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SurvStudio in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SurvStudio"
abstract: >-
  A local survival analysis workbench: Kaplan-Meier curves, Cox models, prognostic
  marker evaluation with family-wise error control, subsample stability and locked
  external validation, and machine-learning and deep-learning survival models compared
  on the same patient splits, with REMARK and TRIPOD+AI reporting checklists.
authors:
  - family-names: "Kang"
    given-names: "Keunsoo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kangk1204/SurvStudio"
url: "https://github.com/kangk1204/SurvStudio"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
keywords:
  - survival analysis
  - Kaplan-Meier
  - Cox proportional hazards
  - prognostic markers
  - multiple testing
  - machine learning
  - reporting guidelines
